/T ( Online drug trafficking on the dark web began to gain traction in the early 2010s with the rise of anonymous drug markets.These markets function similarly to the average legal online commerce services with the main diversion from them being the exploitation of anonymity services.These markets allow vendors to advertise, transfer and profit off of illicit drugs quite easily.The proliferation of these markets harm both the global economy by laundering large amounts of money and average citizens as it creates a platform for them to reach customers remotely. )
