/T ( The most significant and well known drug market on the dark web is the silk road. Silk road was established by Ross Ulbricht in February 2011 and was eventually shut down by law enforcement in 2013. Even though its short lifetime the silk road has managed to deal major harm to the global economy. Some estimates suggest that Silk Road generated up to $1.2 billion in sales and $80 million in commissions, though more conservative estimates are $183 million in sales and $13 million in commissions. The transactions on this market were mostly done with the assist of cryptocurrencies, more specifically bitcoin. The silk road serves as a reminder of the damage that canbe caused by criminals on a network where they cannot be tracked and stopped. )
