/E ( Even though it has been relevant ever since its establishment in the early 2000s dark web as a trend has begun to surge into its major popularity around mid 2010s once smartphones and smart devices became household items. Once smart devices were the standard and the internet became accessible to everyone, people started producing content around the dark web as it seemed like a mysterious and undocumented part of the internet. This proliferation of content centered around the dark web has enabled the general public to be aware of its existence and get curious about the topic so many people have ventured into the dark web and eventually that enables them to either stumble up with or intentionally find the markets. This development of marketing the dark web as something cool and mysterious have caused groups of people to learn about and eventually keep the market going.Using drugs being marketed and labeled as cool is largely a problem around teens and young adults however the combination of both drugs and dark web being labeled as cool is one of the primary reasons that many young people become customers of the markets. )
