/P 233 0 R
/T (b. Adaptability of The Markets )
/E (b. Adaptability of The Markets )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
378 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 234 0 R
/E (shutdown was that the servers could not handle the amount of people using it. The same pattern of several alternative markets getting created can also be seen with the example of the shutdown of Hydra Market in 2022 and Archetyp Market in 2025.This pattern shows that an immediate shutdown of big markets result in both the vendors and the buyers migrating to different platforms which complicates things as now law enforcement has more than one place to investigate and the creation of more platforms means that drugs on the dark web get more accessible as now it can be bought from multiple sources. A long term strategy should therefore focus not only on removing individual marketplaces but also on disrupting the networks that support them. International cooperation and continuous monitoring could help authorities respond more effectively when new platforms emerge. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
