/P 234 0 R
/E (for various reasons by people with malicious intentions. On the other hand it can be argued that the existence of these powerful tools creates a safe space for drug trades to take place. These types of tools are in a way a double edged sword. Both malicious and innocent people use it in their own ways so discarding it entirely is not an option but keeping it so easy to reach also creates danger. Therefore, governments should focus on targeted measures that prevent criminal activity without unnecessarily limiting legitimate users. International cooperation can also help establish common standards for balancing online security, privacy, and law enforcement needs. )
/Pg 24 0 R
