/Title (One of the primary factors that popularized the online drug market is the use of cryptocurrencies.Digital currencies such as bitcoin are frequently used on these types of transactions with the benefits of having multiple degrees of privacy to them. Most of these transactions are quite hard to track because blockchain based currencies encrypt and spread the transaction data into multiple servers.)
